WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.810
How've you been, Lytt?

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.530
Good!

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:10.000
You were gone so long,
I was getting ready to tell everyone

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.410
about you being the evil witch!

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.620
I did promise I'd come back, didn't I?

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:18.540
Yup!

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.810
Well, if it isn't Cayna!

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.820
Marelle! It's been too long!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.090
Welcome back. You're staying with us, I take it?

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:30.000
That was the plan. Can I?

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.140
Of course!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.500
You've been gone for three months,
so tonight we'll celebrate your return…

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.300
With a banquet!

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:14.990
[Return, Mermaid, Misunderstanding, and Zombie]

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:28.080
This headache, and this heartburn…

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.110
These are hangover symptoms.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.600
I know that already…

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.690
I know I've sworn off it before,

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.190
but this time, this time for sure,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.420
I will never, under any circumstance, drink again!

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:43.660
What?!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.990
I'm tellin' you, I really heard it!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.810
It was last night, when I was headin' home.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:54.090
Rottol, you were blind drunk last night.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.800
Yeah, but my ears still worked!

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.600
Miss!

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.050
You're finally with us?

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.370
It's past noon.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.210
Sorry. I've got a real headache.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.000
Bad as ever at holding your drink, huh?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.600
Thanks for pickin' up the tab, Cayna!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.110
That let me have some fine booze.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.210
Thanks a lot!

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:19.600
That was a blast!

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.600
I'm glad you all had fun,

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:23.660
but what's happening here?

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.130
It's the well.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.600
Well, what about it?

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:30.290
There've been weird moans
comin' from it at night lately.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.810
Or, really, more like singing.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:34.900
Singing?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.130
A song from a well?

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.810
Was there a quest like that?

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:46.010
It's kinda creepy, y'know?

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.010
Dunno what we'd do
if something scary was down there.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:55.000
Then how about I go down and check it out?

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:55.940
Would you?

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:56.910
Please, do!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.870
You don't need to think twice about it?

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.120
It's fine. This village has been good to me,

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.130
and I intend to keep letting it,
so this is nothing.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.220
Oh, uh, nothing.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.200
We'll have that talk later.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.910
Miss, will you be okay?

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:19.840
I'll be fine. If anything, the cold water
might cure my hangover.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.700
That's not what I meant…

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.810
Won't it be dangerous?

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.490
You don't need to worry about me.
I'll be bringing a guide.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.000
A guide?

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.050
Just watch.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.810
Load Summon Magic: Aqua, Level 2.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.460
You sure are somethin'!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.420
Water fishies!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.430
Whassat getup?

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.220
I've never seen its like.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:56.140
This makes it easier to move around in water.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:57.720
Alright, I'm off!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.530
It's colder than I expected it to be…

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.100
Water temperature: 10 degrees C.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:16.210
Water is likely snowmelt runoff.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.710
Well, it sobered me up quick.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.660
Control Body Temperature.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.220
There, that's better.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.500
Well? You sense anything?

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.230
That way?

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.110
Key, how far have I gone?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.010
About 100 meters.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.640
There is an open cavern above here.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.070
Is someone there?

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.590
Load Summon Magic: Shye, Level 7.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.400
I-I'm sorry! Please, forgive me!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.610
A mermaid?!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.310
D-Don't eat me!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.730
I wouldn't!

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.200
Y-You won't eat me?

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:36.510
Do I look like a mer-meat eater to you?!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.350
You don't… not look like one.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.620
What's that mean?!

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.610
Y-You don't look like one! At all!

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.870
That's better.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.910
These are just water spirits, so…

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.400
G-Guardian deities?!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.840
F-Forgive my rudeness!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.290
Water spirits are your guardian deities?

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:02.510
The legends of my village speak of them
as being shaped like whales,

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.580
but they can also be flying fish?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.690
Forgive my ignorance!

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:10.010
It's fine, I get it. Let's just calm down.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.370
O-Okay…

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.420
I'm Cayna. What's your name?

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:15.940
I'm Mimily.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.280
So, Mimily, why are you in here?

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.120
Don't mermaids live in the ocean?

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:22.990
About that…

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:28.300
I was swimming near my village
about a week ago, when…

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.920
When I came to, I was here.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.800
And what ocean is your village in?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.810
I'm not sure…

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.400
I do know it's on the floor of a deep ocean.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:57.620
I see…

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:01.370
Sounds like getting home
would be pretty tough, then.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:10.400
There is a song you can only hear…

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:12.610
on nights…

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:20.480
streaked with shooting stars…

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:28.910
Sending a blue wave from her tail,

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:36.600
Mother sings you a…

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.610
What's that?

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.290
A song from my homeland.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:40.610
I'm so lonely…

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.870
Lullabye…

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:48.610
They must have heard this song
coming from the well.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:54.400
…wrapped up in the ocean's warm embrace…

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.060
Alright, let's do this!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.290
Will you be okay up on the surface?

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.890
Y-Yes, as long as there's water.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.580
Why do you ask?

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:08.730
I was thinking we'd have you
stay at the village for a bit.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.390
Come on, let's go!

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.500
A mermaid?!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.840
And, as it turns out, she's lost.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:27.290
Can she stay in the village for a little while?

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.110
I'm sorry to impose.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.320
I don't really mind, but…

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.210
How do mermaids normally live?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.290
Can we even take care of her?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.810
I don't think you have to worry that much.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.010
She can eat all the same things as you do,

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:48.900
and as long as she has water,
Mimily can take care of the rest herself.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.000
Well, if that's how it is. Right?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.620
Yeah, that should be fine.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:53.570
Yup, it oughta.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.400
Alright, Cayna.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.800
Nice to meet you, Miss Mermaid!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.110
Likewise! Thank you all so much!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.580
Great idea!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.710
The public bath's a great place for her!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.500
How's the water?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.810
It's perfect!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.970
So you can handle warm water, then?

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:20.660
As long as it doesn't get warmer.
But may I really stay here?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.990
You bet! And you won't have to worry
about drying out here!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.840
Think of it as your own.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:28.000
Thank you so much!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.550
Isn't that great?

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:33.810
Marelle, ladies, thanks for taking care of Mimily.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.670
Just leave it to us!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.710
We made up our minds to do it,
so we'll do it right!

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.220
Mimily's already a member of our village!

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:44.220
Really? Truly, thank you very much!

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:49.320
Well, I'm gonna get going, but I'll be back
to check on you before long.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.700
O-Okay…

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.630
I'll be looking for your village.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.790
I hope you can find it!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.420
Miss, you'll come back, right?

00:10:58.690 --> 00:10:59.710
I sure will.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.420
But isn't the capital far?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.920
Going there and back
so often sounds really hard…

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.490
Don't worry! I told you I'm the witch, right?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:17.620
Once I've been somewhere, I can use my magic
to get there in a flash, no matter how far I am.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.520
Really?! Miss, that's so cool!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.270
And I can fly, too!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.120
Whoa…

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.990
Hey, Lytt. Wanna fly with me next time?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.490
In the sky?

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:36.210
If we go on a day with nice weather, I bet
we could see really far. It'd be real pretty.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:40.220
Um, but… My mom…

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.910
When the time comes,
I'll ask Marelle along with you.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.210
If she agrees, we'll go. Okay?

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:51.210
O-Okay! It's a promise!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:52.130
Yup, a promise.

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:00.400
So, what was that dark hole, anyway?

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:11.580
They're here!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.310
The knights of Felskeilo!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.010
Clean those bandits right up!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:25.890
You can do it!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.700
Get everyone on the wagons. We're speeding up.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.310
Yes, sir, at once.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.110
Captain, look there.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:37.980
What is it?

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.240
Wait, that's…

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:46.860
Hey there.

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.310
What are you doing?

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:53.910
Planning to blast us away
along with the bandits if we don't fight well?

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:58.100
What makes you think I'm here to inspect you, hm?

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.890
I'm going to find the Dragon King's palace.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.730
Ah, the thing Cohral told us about?

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:07.520
And so I was gonna tag along
until we got to that village.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.920
I mean, it's no fun traveling alone.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.910
Well, I suppose that's fine,

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.120
but we were about to pick up the pace.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.810
Were you? What to do…

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.920
Guess I'll summon a therwolf, and…

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.410
I'll make an exception and give you a ride!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:31.730
Pay it no mind.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:34.610
This is thanks for battling the event monster.

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:36.480
What's wrong?

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:46.020
O-Oh, crap! There are other ways
to give her a ride!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.640
Why did I choose to carry her like a bride?!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:53.700
Sorry… I wasn't thinking.

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:56.320
Y-You were trying to do me a favor.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.170
I get it.

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.890
Well, uh… Let's go, then?

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.310
Hey, check it out.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.600
She his girlfriend?

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:11.710
I didn't know…

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.990
Shining Saber, you idiot!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.910
Oh, uh… Sorry.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:17.910
This wasn't my intent.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.790
My bad.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.480
Captain, I didn't know you had a squeeze!

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.130
Squeeze?!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.590
The heck you talkin' about?

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.380
Oh, you two were dating?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.790
Come on, you gotta tell us these things!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:33.670
H-Hey…

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:34.510
Stop…

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:38.190
Wow, you're so into her
you'd bring her on a mission!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.120
Hey, wait, hang on!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.430
That's not it at all! Don't get it wrong!

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:46.310
You'll hurt your girl's feelings
if you deny it in front of her.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.600
Just man up and admit it, will ya?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.710
We'd all be rooting for you.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.120
Isn't that right?!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:53.600
Yeah!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.450
How can you pinch that hard?!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.780
Don't underestimate a Skill Master!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.680
I have the Pain Doubler skill, you know!

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.900
I said I was sorry!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.620
Look at them flirt.

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.520
It's nice to see the captain looking so happy.

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.690
Yeah, you said it!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.270
Lady Cayna, this tastes incredible!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:24.830
It's the best, Lady Cayna!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.720
Lady Cayna, it's so lovely!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:29.280
I'm glad you all like it,

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.100
but what's with the "Lady"?

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:36.090
I've never gotten to eat
anything so tasty out on a mission before…

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:40.600
Talk about exaggerating. What have you
been eating all this time?

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:43.320
Hardtack, jerky, and water. That's it.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.120
Oh. Really?

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.290
Anyway, she is absolutely not my girlfriend.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.690
My apologies for confusing you.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:55.990
Lady Cayna, please don't leave us partway.
Stay with us forever!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.710
Yes, please, Lady Cayna!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.190
Were you even listening to me?!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.920
Yeah, yeah, I bet she isn't.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:08.110
Yeah, she's not your girlfriend,
and we'll leave it at that, Captain.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:10.300
Yup, we hear you loud and clear.

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:13.790
Good, you understand. Glad to hear it.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:17.980
These people don't believe
a word you're saying, Shining Saber.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:23.500
And hey, Cayna is Head Priest
Skargo's mom, isn't she?

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:24.900
So that means…

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:29.000
The captain's into that sort of thing?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:30.320
What sort of thing?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.840
Really, widows, of all people?

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:34.070
Didn't expect that.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:39.510
So, Captain, you're gonna have
the head priest call you "Dad," right?!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:43.280
And Mai-Mai will be calling him "Father"…

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.890
I'm so jealous!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.110
Something's wrong with these knights.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.600
I didn't train them well enough. Sorry.

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:57.770
If anything, they really have
that "Shining Saber" feel to them.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:01.310
Are you complimenting me or insulting me?

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.490
Complimenting, I think?

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.210
Why are you questioning that?!

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:08.670
You're such a good match, Captain!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.200
Dammit, guys!

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:15.300
Is he beloved or bullied here?

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.810
I worry about this country.

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:45.310
We should reach the fishing village
tomorrow afternoon.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.820
Really? Thanks.

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:51.680
So you really won't be
staying with us the whole way?

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.430
What a shame…

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:59.720
Hey, I'll give you the Cooking Skills skill,

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.070
so use it to feed them
something decent, would you?

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:05.420
O-Okay. I will.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:11.060
Install!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.210
What was that?

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.410
O-Oh, nothing.

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:21.790
You remind of all those players shouting
"gimme, gimme" in Leadale. That's a laugh.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:27.110
I always thought Cooking Skills
was a worthless skill in the game,

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.980
but now I can see its true value.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.700
Didn't you know?

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:37.410
There were quests you could only take
by feeding characters their favorite foods.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.120
For reals?!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:42.190
And they gave such useful combat skills, too…

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.500
Ugh…

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.320
Go down this road and you'll hit the village.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:51.780
Thanks for having me along this far.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.090
Good luck with those bandits!

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.330
Thanks. You be careful, too.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:57.790
Lady Cayna!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.290
Take care!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:03.410
Come visit the knights' barracks
next time you're in Felskeilo!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.690
Stay safe out there!

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:06.800
Cripes.

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.110
You guys take care, too!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.620
That was pretty fun.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:20.790
It's nice traveling in groups like that.

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.350
It's too quiet…

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.520
I can't even hear any seabirds.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.800
The wind is warm…

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.680
This feels wrong.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.100
The village is covered in fog?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:50.040
Wasn't there a horror movie like this?

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:51.670
What was it called…?

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.510
My master! Heigl has joined the fray!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.330
Don't show up swinging your spear around.
That's dangerous.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.320
My contritions.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:14.230
But my word…

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:17.190
I have scarce felt such a disquieting miasma.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:18.600
Yeah, same.

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.030
I will strengthen your defenses.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.910
You should hide, Li'l Fairy.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.300
Let's go.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:33.930
Yes'm!

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.100
I can't see a thing…

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:53.320
And probing magic isn't working.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.890
This fog has a hindering effect.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:21:01.890
Yeah… I feel like I've seen
a quest like this somewhere, but…

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.580
[Heigl]

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.500
Heigl's HP is low?!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.510
The fog also has a damage effect?!

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:16.710
My master!

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:19.510
Heigl!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:22.960
A zombie?!

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.810
Real zombies sure do smell…

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.590
May you emerge… victorious, mas… ter…

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:34.880
Heigl!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.020
It took Heigl down so easily…

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.590
This zombie must be a really high level.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.230
To create a zombie of this level…

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.010
Yeah, I know.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:48.640
A player made it.

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:54.610
Magic Skill: Dyul!

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:04.390
It may be high level, but it's no match for me.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:09.490
Now, then, what do you suppose
is waiting for me up ahead?
